          "h": "A replacement with a new identity",
          "b": "The ReplicaSet controller writes a new Pod with a new name and UID. The scheduler puts it on node-2 this time, so it has a new IP too. The Service updates itself; anything that remembered the old name or IP is now wrong."
        },
        {
